{
  "_doc": "`pip config list` 的输出 → 作用于 `pip install` 的键（节只认 global / install / :env:，键名按 pip 规范化）与生效的 index-url。严格同源对：引擎 `deprepair.pip_config_keys` ↔ 插件 `server.pip_config_items` / `pip_config_index_url`（#737），两侧各读本文件，不读对方源码。`keys` 排好序；`index_section` 为 null 表示没有作用于安装的 index-url。",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "pip 25 的真实输出：download 节不算，:env: 压过 install 压过 global",
      "text": "download.index-url='https://c.example/s'\nglobal.index-url='https://a.example/simple'\nglobal.timeout='5'\ninstall.index-url='https://b.example/x?token=1'\n:env:.config-file='/home/alice/pip.conf'\n:env:.extra-index-url='https://x https://y'\n:env:.index-url='https://e.example/simple'\n",
      "keys": ["config-file", "extra-index-url", "index-url", "timeout"],
      "index_url": "https://e.example/simple",
      "index_section": ":env:"
    },
    {
      "name": "只有 download.index-url：不作用于 pip install",
      "text": "download.index-url='https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/'\n",
      "keys": [],
      "index_url": null,
      "index_section": null
    },
    {
      "name": "pip index 命令自己的节也不算",
      "text": "index.index-url='https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/'\nglobal.timeout='30'\n",
      "keys": ["timeout"],
      "index_url": null,
      "index_section": null
    },
    {
      "name": "install 压过 global（不管谁先打印）",
      "text": "install.index-url='https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/'\nglobal.index-url='https://pypi.org/simple'\n",
      "keys": ["index-url"],
      "index_url": "https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/",
      "index_section": "install"
    },
    {
      "name": "键名规范化：--index-url / INDEX_URL / index_url 是同一个键，同一节后出现的生效",
      "text": "global.--index-url='https://first.example/simple'\nglobal.INDEX_URL='https://second.example/simple'\nglobal.index_url='https://third.example/simple'\n",
      "keys": ["index-url"],
      "index_url": "https://third.example/simple",
      "index_section": "global"
    },
    {
      "name": "节名大小写不敏感",
      "text": "GLOBAL.Index-Url='https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/'\n",
      "keys": ["index-url"],
      "index_url": "https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/",
      "index_section": "global"
    },
    {
      "name": "离线 wheelhouse 与 no-index 只是键，不给地址",
      "text": "global.find-links='/srv/wheels'\ninstall.no-index='true'\n:env:.extra-index-url='https://extra.example/simple'\n",
      "keys": ["extra-index-url", "find-links", "no-index"],
      "index_url": null,
      "index_section": null
    },
    {
      "name": "认不出形状的行跳过：警告、没有等号、没有节",
      "text": "WARNING: the config file is not readable\nglobal\nindex-url='https://nosection.example/simple'\n\n   \n",
      "keys": [],
      "index_url": null,
      "index_section": null
    },
    {
      "name": "值里有等号与查询串：只按第一个等号切",
      "text": "install.index-url='https://m.example/simple?token=a=b'\n",
      "keys": ["index-url"],
      "index_url": "https://m.example/simple?token=a=b",
      "index_section": "install"
    },
    {
      "name": "写了空值也是「设了这个键」：两侧的「设没设」逐条一致，空地址由插件调用方当没配",
      "text": "global.index-url=''\n",
      "keys": ["index-url"],
      "index_url": "",
      "index_section": "global"
    },
    {
      "name": "空输出：什么都没配（= PyPI 默认）",
      "text": "",
      "keys": [],
      "index_url": null,
      "index_section": null
    }
  ]
}
